WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:11.603
Kara: You lost your necklace?

2
00:00:11.604 --> 00:00:15.479
Daisy: Yes. The one I just made.

3
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:19.803
Kara: Oh right. At your party.

4
00:00:19.804 --> 00:00:23.488
Daisy: I have to find it.

5
00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:26.454
Kara: Well, you can't look for it now.

6
00:00:26.455 --> 00:00:27.578
Daisy: But I—

7
00:00:27.579 --> 00:00:30.286
Miss Gray: Five more minutes, Room Two!

8
00:00:30.287 --> 00:00:32.000
Kara: I told you!

9
00:00:32.001 --> 00:00:35.851
We have to finish our map now.

10
00:00:35.852 --> 00:00:43.373
Daisy: Okay. I'll look for my necklace later.

11
00:00:43.374 --> 00:00:51.746
Daisy: Let's go draw the bike rack.

12
00:00:51.747 --> 00:00:54.511
Miss Gray: Good job getting started, Room Two.

13
00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:56.067
Now for homework—

14
00:00:56.068 --> 00:00:57.801
Mark: Homework?

15
00:00:57.802 --> 00:01:00.464
Miss Gray: Yes, homework.

16
00:01:00.465 --> 00:01:04.253
I want you to turn your drawings into posters.

17
00:01:04.254 --> 00:01:08.097
Miss Gray: Then we can hang up your maps in our classroom.

18
00:01:08.098 --> 00:01:10.519
Mark: Good idea, Miss Gray!

19
00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:14.681
No one will ever get lost on the playground again!

20
00:01:14.682 --> 00:01:19.143
Kids: Ha-ha!

21
00:01:19.144 --> 00:01:22.143
Jenna: Did you look for your necklace near the swings?

22
00:01:22.144 --> 00:01:23.765
Daisy: Yes.

23
00:01:23.766 --> 00:01:26.302
Jenna: Under the slide?

24
00:01:26.303 --> 00:01:28.962
Daisy: I looked everywhere!

25
00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:31.044
But the playground is so big.

26
00:01:31.045 --> 00:01:33.425
Daisy: I'm never going to find it.

27
00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:36.009
Kara: Daisy, you weren't listening.

28
00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:39.311
Kara: Miss Gray just said we have homework tonight.

29
00:01:39.312 --> 00:01:41.489
Daisy: I was listening, Kara!

30
00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:44.203
I'm just thinking about my necklace.

31
00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:47.035
Kara: Well, we have to make a poster.

32
00:01:47.036 --> 00:01:49.416
Kara: Do you want to come to my house tonight?

33
00:01:49.417 --> 00:01:51.478
We can work on it then.

34
00:01:51.479 --> 00:02:00.112
Daisy: Yeah, sure. Whatever.

35
00:02:00.113 --> 00:02:04.288
Daisy: Mom, I'm home!

36
00:02:04.289 --> 00:02:06.511
I lost my new necklace.

37
00:02:06.512 --> 00:02:10.893
Daisy: And I have to go to mean Kara's house tonight!
